## A function keeps the 32 terms with the largest constants and merges the
## rest into one term that bounds them, and the expression says so. main calls
## 40 functions of distinct frame sizes, each of which calls an uninstrumented
## function of its own, so it has 40 incomparable paths: the 32 largest stay
## and the 8 smallest become one term with the constant of the eighth, 0x2070,
## and all of their unknowns. The stack usage and the reasons are not affected.
## Only main has a symbol, the rest are named by address.

# RUN: yaml2obj %s -o %t
# RUN: llvm-stack-size %t --entry-point=main | FileCheck %s --match-full-lines
# RUN: llvm-stack-size %t --entry-point=0x2070 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=F8 --match-full-lines

#      CHECK:Entry point: main (0x1000)
# CHECK-NEXT:  Stack usage: at least 336 bytes (lower bound)
# CHECK-NEXT:  Stack usage expression (coarsened): max(336 + calls(0x3270), 328 + calls(0x3260), 320 + calls(0x3250), 312 + calls(0x3240), 304 + calls(0x3230), 296 + calls(0x3220), 288 + calls(0x3210), 280 + calls(0x3200), 272 + calls(0x31f0), 264 + calls(0x31e0), 256 + calls(0x31d0), 248 + calls(0x31c0), 240 + calls(0x31b0), 232 + calls(0x31a0), 224 + calls(0x3190), 216 + calls(0x3180), 208 + calls(0x3170), 200 + calls(0x3160), 192 + calls(0x3150), 184 + calls(0x3140), 176 + calls(0x3130), 168 + calls(0x3120), 160 + calls(0x3110), 152 + calls(0x3100), 144 + calls(0x30f0), 136 + calls(0x30e0), 128 + calls(0x30d0), 120 + calls(0x30c0), 112 + calls(0x30b0), 104 + calls(0x30a0), 96 + calls(0x3090), 88 + calls(0x3080), 80 + calls(0x3000) + calls(0x3010) + calls(0x3020) + calls(0x3030) + calls(0x3040) + calls(0x3050) + calls(0x3060) + calls(0x3070))
# CHECK-NEXT:  Lower bound because:
# CHECK-NEXT:    unknown callees: 0x3000 (0x3000), called by 0x2000 (0x2000)

#      F8:Entry point: 0x2070 (0x2070)
# F8-NEXT:  Stack usage: at least 64 bytes (lower bound)
# F8-NEXT:  Stack usage expression: 64 + calls(0x3070)

